// for multi-sensor change detection analysis in Google Earth Engine.  \
    \
// Key Features:\
// - Multi-sensor support:  Allows the user to select from Landsat 5, 7, 8, 9, MODIS, Sentinel-1, and Sentinel-2 imagery.\
// - Flexible temporal configuration: Users can define expectation and target years and date ranges within each year.\
// - Customizable data reduction: Supports various reduction methods, including NBR, SWIR, and NDVI.\
// - Interactive interface:  Provides a user-friendly interface to control parameters, visualize results, and export analysis outputs.\
// - Multiple result viewing modes:  Offers charts, movies, and analysis tools to explore the change detection results.\
