// 3. UI Panels: \
//    - First Panel:  Controls for general settings, DSA, sensor selection, data reduction, etc.\
//    - Third Panel:  Displays results and provides analysis tools, viewing modes, and export options.\
// 4. Core Logic:\
//    - afn_runBULCD_Code(): Executes the BULC-D algorithm, processes inputs, calls the algorithm, and displays results.\
//    - getLinkedMaps(): Creates linked maps for visualizing input data and results.\
//    - getAnalysisResults(): Provides controls for interpreting and analyzing the BULC-D outputs.\
// 5. Additional Functions:  Includes functions like showModes() for switching result viewing modes.\
\
// Usage:\
